# ==============================================================================
# QUANT SCANNER SCHEDULES
# Cron Format: [Min] [Hour] [Day-of-Month] [Month] [Day-of-Week] [User] [Command]
#
# Timezone: container TZ (default America/New_York via docker-compose .env)
# Universe:  shared data/tickers.txt for all scanners (falls back to Yahoo most-actives)
# Archive:   each job writes to data/output/ and data/history/YYYY-MM-DD/ + DuckDB
# Dashboard: quant-view reads breakout, swing, and lynch JSON via Strategy selector
# Logs:      stdout/stderr appended to /app/logs/cron.log
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Breakout Scanner (quant-daily)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runs: Mon–Fri at 17:17 (5:17 PM)
# Command: quant-daily  (= quant-scan --report both --archive --email)
# Outputs: breakout_scan_{results,report,summary}.{csv,json,md}
#          Emails Tier 1 + Tier 2 when SMTP_* / EMAIL_* env vars are set
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
17 17 * * 1-5 root . /etc/environment; quant-daily >> /app/logs/cron.log 2>&1

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Swing Pullback Scanner (quant-swing)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runs: Mon–Fri at 17:27 (5:27 PM) — 10 min after breakout to reduce API overlap
# Command: quant-swing --report both --archive
# Outputs: swing_scan_{results,report,summary}.{csv,json,md}
# Tiers:    A (≥80), B (65–79), C, filtered
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
27 17 * * 1-5 root . /etc/environment; quant-swing --report both --archive >> /app/logs/cron.log 2>&1

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Peter Lynch Scanner (quant-lynch)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runs: Fridays only at 18:17 (6:17 PM)
# Command: quant-lynch --report both --archive  (preset: summary — all categories)
# Outputs: lynch_scan_{results,report,summary}.{csv,json,md}
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
17 18 * * 5 root . /etc/environment; quant-lynch --report both --archive >> /app/logs/cron.log 2>&1
